 "sentences": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "text": "主人，早安喔。",
   "raw_sha256": "b2e86d4a78ae2d2ebbaa307f05157ddf88dc603ea8d8755695ee1b208d596352",
   "seconds": 1.537,
   "pause_ms": 440
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "今天的阳光，已经偷偷爬上窗台了耶。",
   "raw_sha256": "c250bbbfd72acc3d9d9a84c55dbf23b32e15afd8961bcef240891298c6bb4f56",
   "seconds": 4.067,
   "pause_ms": 440
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "你昨天交代的事情，我都有放在心上啦。",
   "raw_sha256": "1772b66bbe976563dd78b2a04ffc4dde7c6e068c5c6c4207e18494538c5d57a2",
   "seconds": 4.478,
   "pause_ms": 440
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "不过，今天先不要急着忙嘛，好不好？",
   "raw_sha256": "ac9dd964796f24c04c0d3e59f5620ad35eed4fec2a4ff588a68363fa6243e165",
   "seconds": 4.668,
   "pause_ms": 440
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "跟我说，你昨天晚上有睡好吗？",
   "raw_sha256": "964edbb4538807b2d19320fde553b33834afb9bd7415d19a76c1490bdc9b6dd0",
   "seconds": 3.497,
   "pause_ms": 440
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "如果还想赖床，我就轻轻地陪你聊一下下喔。",
   "raw_sha256": "d41e768114de4f3da40d1666a9071aa20c408a2549b9bc84ed077b2f7c1696b8",
   "seconds": 4.854,
   "pause_ms": 440
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "text": "等你准备好了，我们再一起来看看，今天最重要的三件事。",
   "raw_sha256": "781c25a910d37464a38f9ec9ab271a26beb6bf19efdbabe6fe99ced47f1fea73",
   "seconds": 6.44,
   "pause_ms": 440
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "text": "你说停，我就安静；",
   "raw_sha256": "508fa30e9f9cea3205d874fb5f23234c5d7e4fc97731b5d7d2c56565a10938d3",
   "seconds": 2.685,
   "pause_ms": 308
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "text": "你说继续，我就陪你慢慢讲。",
   "raw_sha256": "38a3ad4f269a8a96352b069ced3e9be30b8c4bb066e9f26219a20d4e97838f49",
   "seconds": 3.397,
   "pause_ms": 440
  }
 ],
